    qa: [
      { q: 'What advantage did the zoetrope have over Plateau\'s disc?', choices: ['Its pictures looked much brighter than before', 'It could be projected on a wall', 'It worked without any slits or mirrors', 'Several people could watch at once'], answer: 3, why: '第5段落 several people standing around it could watch at the same time。' },
      { q: 'What does making a strip for a zoetrope require?', choices: ['Learning to build electric motors and lights', 'Splitting an action into small stages', 'Printing the pictures in many bright colours', 'Taking photographs of real running horses'], answer: 1, why: '第6段落 dividing an action into stages and changing each drawing by a small, regular amount。' },
    ],
