    qa: [
      { q: 'Why do yatsude flowers attract many insects?', choices: ['Their petals are huge', 'Few other plants bloom at that time', 'Their smell is said to keep illness away', 'Birds carry insects to the plant in early spring'], answer: 1, why: '第4段落：この時期にはほかに花をさかせている植物が少ないので、こん虫を引きよせるとある。' },
      { q: 'What did gardeners create by crossing yatsude with ivy?', choices: ['A hybrid with features of both plants', 'A new kind of ivy', 'A plant that produces black fruit in early autumn', 'A shrub that can grow only in very sunny gardens'], answer: 0, why: '第6段落：ツタとかけ合わせて、両方の特徴をもつ雑種を作り出したとある。' },
    ],
