    qa: [
      { q: 'What causes the ball of the artillery fungus to fly into the air?', choices: ['A layer that suddenly turns inside out', 'Wind blowing across the top of the open cup', 'Animals stepping on it', 'Heat from the sun that dries the ball quickly'], answer: 0, why: '第3段落：おわんの内側の層がとつぜん裏返り、そのすばやい動きで玉が投げ出されるとある。' },
      { q: 'Why have some homeowners had trouble with this fungus?', choices: ['It destroys the roots of their garden trees', 'It gives off a strong smell inside the house', 'It makes the wood chips burn too easily', 'Its sticky balls mark walls and cars'], answer: 3, why: '第5・6段落：ねばねばした玉がかべや車にくっつき、取りのぞきにくい黒い点になるとある。' },
    ],
